    var result = { outfit: _drManualSelectionToOutfit(picked), reason: '用户手动从衣柜挑选单品完成搭配', vibe: '手动搭配完成', reactionContext: targetIsUser ? 'user_self' : 'user_to_role', occasion: '手动搭配', refItems: _drCollectUploadedRefsFromPickedMap(p.id, picked, targetIsUser, targetIsUser ? (_getUserProfile().name || '用户') : (p.name || '角色')) };
    _drState.coordOutfit = result;
    _drState.coordRecordId = _drAddRecord('coord', { type:'coord', coordMode:_drState.coordMode, outfit:result.outfit, reason:result.reason, vibe:result.vibe, reactionContext:result.reactionContext, date:_drNowDateText(), savedAt:Date.now(), manual:true }, targetIsUser);
    var resultCard = document.getElementById('drCoordResultCard');
